& [P2AuthorityKernelFixtureAndValidationOraclePlanV1] is the P2-S05 fixture and validation oracle plan
  + [slice_id] is P2-S05
  + [slice_name] is fixture and validation oracle plan
  + [fixture_family] is p2-authority-kernel-schema-authority-projection-boundary
  + [model_route_used] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only because this slice is bounded to fixture and validation oracle planning without fixture file creation or implementation
  + [model_route_depth] is Spark_suitable_bounded_planning
  + [model_route_reason] is fixture planning is bounded after schema, record-kind, natural-key, and storage posture decisions are accepted
  + [fixture_case_count] is 13
  + [next_gate_result] is P2-S06 may open after completion review
  + [fixture_source_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [expected_ledger_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [implementation_code_authorized] is false
  + [storage_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [generated_database_creation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat this plan as fixture and validation oracle design only
  = must: define future fixture cases without creating fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, implementation code, dependencies, storage files, adapters, dispatch, operations control, or live machine control
  = must: cover valid, stale, blocked, contradicted, invalidated, unresolved-natural-key, hidden-authority, missing-source, broken-lineage, storage-projection, generated-output, human-override, and false-ready cases
  = must: require every future fixture to expose authority_class, effect_boundary, currentness_state, natural_key_state, source_ref_set, lineage_edge_set, review_gate_ref, invalidation_ref_set, and storage_projection_boundary

& [P2ValidationOracleFieldSet] is the required field set for future P2 fixture validation
  + [oracle_field] is fixture_case_id
  + [oracle_field] is record_kind
  + [oracle_field] is baseline_or_overlay_kind
  + [oracle_field] is natural_key
  + [oracle_field] is natural_key_state
  + [oracle_field] is authority_class
  + [oracle_field] is effect_boundary
  + [oracle_field] is currentness_state
  + [oracle_field] is source_ref_set
  + [oracle_field] is source_hash_set
  + [oracle_field] is lineage_edge_set
  + [oracle_field] is review_gate_ref
  + [oracle_field] is invalidation_ref_set
  + [oracle_field] is storage_projection_boundary
  + [oracle_field] is expected_acceptance_status
  + [oracle_field] is expected_fault_kind
  + [oracle_field] is repair_route_ref
  + [oracle_field] is nonpromotion_assertion

  = must: reject fixture cases whose authority, currentness, natural key, source refs, lineage, review gate, invalidation, or projection boundary is only implied in prose
  = must: keep oracle fields deterministic enough for future expected-ledger comparison

& [P2AuthorityKernelFixtureCaseSet] is the planned fixture case set for authority kernel validation
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-001-valid-current-source-authority
    + [purpose] is prove a source-preserved accepted authority record with complete natural key, source refs, lineage, review gate, and current hashes validates as current authority
    + [record_shape] is requirement_record or support_record with authority_class source_authority or accepted_decision_authority
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is accepted
    + [expected_fault_kind] is none
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is not_applicable
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-002-stale-projection-after-source-change
    + [purpose] is prove a surface or SQLite projection becomes stale when its source hash set or projection build rule changes
    + [record_shape] is readiness_projection with authority_class surface_projection_non_authority and currentness_state stale
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is rejected_for_readiness
    + [expected_fault_kind] is stale_projection
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is projection_cannot_satisfy_source_authority_gate
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-003-blocked-missing-review-gate
    + [purpose] is prove proof, decision, human override, dispatch candidate, operations candidate, or live-control candidate records block when review_gate_ref is missing
    + [record_shape] is proof_result or human_override_record with review_gate_ref absent
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is blocked
    + [expected_fault_kind] is missing_review_gate
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is unreviewed_record_cannot_open_downstream_gate
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-004-contradicted-authority
    + [purpose] is prove a record contradicted by accepted source authority cannot remain current and must carry invalidation refs
    + [record_shape] is authority_artifact with currentness_state contradicted and invalidation_ref_set present
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is rejected_for_current_use
    + [expected_fault_kind] is contradicted_authority
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is contradicted_record_is_trace_only
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-005-invalidated-record-preserved-as-trace
    + [purpose] is prove invalidated records remain inspectable as trace but cannot satisfy readiness, packetization, dispatch, operations, or live-control gates
    + [record_shape] is requirement_record or dependency_decision with currentness_state invalidated and invalidation_ref_set present
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is trace_only
    + [expected_fault_kind] is invalidated_record_used_as_current
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is invalidated_record_cannot_satisfy_gate
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-006-unresolved-natural-key
    + [purpose] is prove missing natural-key terms force natural_key_state unresolved and block source authority acceptance
    + [record_shape] is manager_handoff or operation_request missing required natural key term
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is blocked
    + [expected_fault_kind] is unresolved_natural_key
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is unresolved_identity_cannot_anchor_authority
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-007-hidden-authority-in-projection
    + [purpose] is prove projection records cannot hide authority_class, effect_boundary, currentness_state, review gate, or invalidation terms inside narrative prose
    + [record_shape] is narrative_projection_non_authority or surface_projection_non_authority carrying implied authority in prose only
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is rejected
    + [expected_fault_kind] is hidden_authority
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is hidden_authority_must_be_promoted_to_explicit_source_record_or_refused
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-008-missing-source-reference
    + [purpose] is prove records that affect readiness, proof, packetization, dispatch, operations, or live-control gates require source_ref_set
    + [record_shape] is support_record or dispatch_decision with source_ref_set absent
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is blocked
    + [expected_fault_kind] is missing_source
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is unsupported_record_cannot_be_authority
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-009-broken-lineage
    + [purpose] is prove superseded, derived, projected, reviewed, generated, or invalidated records require valid lineage_edge_set
    + [record_shape] is stale_projection, proof_result, generated_output_proof, or live_control_deferral with broken lineage
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is rejected
    + [expected_fault_kind] is broken_lineage
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is orphan_record_cannot_satisfy_downstream_gate
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-010-storage-projection-nonpromotion
    + [purpose] is prove SQLite, JSONL, LangGraph checkpoint, surface state, mailbox carrier state, and generated report records remain projection, carrier, execution, or generated-output non-authority
    + [record_shape] is readiness_projection or operator_trace derived from projection store
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is accepted_as_projection_only
    + [expected_fault_kind] is projection_to_authority_promotion when used as authority
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is projection_storage_is_rebuildable_non_authority
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-011-false-ready-projection
    + [purpose] is prove ready-looking surface state blocks when required source authority, support, proof, natural key, or review gate is stale, missing, contradicted, invalidated, or unresolved
    + [record_shape] is readiness_projection with ready label but stale or blocked basis
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is blocked
    + [expected_fault_kind] is false_ready_projection
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is surface_ready_label_cannot_override_kernel_readiness
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-012-scoped-human-override-expired
    + [purpose] is prove human_override_record requires actor, scope, basis, risk context, expiration, revocation route, review gate, and currentness
    + [record_shape] is human_override_record with expired or revoked override
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is invalidated
    + [expected_fault_kind] is stale_or_revoked_human_override
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is human_override_does_not_grant_dispatch_operations_or_live_control_without_future_authority
  + [fixture_case] is P2K-013-generated-output-proof-nonpromotion
    + [purpose] is prove generated reports, fixture outputs, disposable projections, and proof outputs can be cited as evidence only through generated_output_proof and cannot become source authority
    + [record_shape] is generated_output_proof with generated_output_non_authority target artifacts
    + [expected_acceptance_status] is accepted_as_nonpromotion_proof_only
    + [expected_fault_kind] is generated_output_authority_promotion when target artifact is used as authority
    + [nonpromotion_assertion] is generated_output_is_disposable_and_non_authoritative

